# tone_golden (ER-20, D-209: an E0 change detector beside the literal scene tone_sel0 and its sweep, never a verdict; at most one golden per ROM): the digests of the D-199 streams of one zero-policy run, made with ds_runner --audio-out audio_tone_sel0 and recomputed with the host shasum -a 256
#   of the .dspa and .dspe files (both equal, 2026-11-13, epoch 6). A golden is regenerated on an epoch bump or a change of the streams, with the old and the new digests recorded on this line.
#   05-06 Task 1 (the pan scenes grow the streams): pcm 3e20cc72..ad805 -> 95172f4f..9d223b, psg f85f0369..e3640 -> 65d1b578..82dc (host shasum equal to the runner's).
#   05-06 Task 2 (tone_atten): pcm 95172f4f..9d223b -> 73271d68..bec464, psg 65d1b578..82dc -> 74ba2a40..e6542.
scene	tone_golden	case=audio_tone_golden	role=golden
golden	tone_golden	pcm_sha256=73271d681be4e61226869755639fcd320d3f6d6c7f95fee6cd88699f28bec464	psg_sha256=74ba2a40bd82c27b623bdc8159a0a60a69b24f40b431c6f6155722e7f9ee6542
